  wiki: RuneScape
  // the Truthcoin reserve: 💰 Stimulus pays every cleared program the same
  // amount, three times a night; 🎁 Grant pays one cleared program, three
  // times a night; 🧊 Freeze stops one program's coin going out for ten
  // minutes (it can still receive). A property, not a hook — she stays a guest.
  wallet: minter, limit 3, grants 3, freeze 10m, while program.cleared == true

